WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
Most of Paul's letters
open with a thanksgiving.

2
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:04.860
This one does not.

3
00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:10.400
Instead: I marvel that you are so
quickly deserting him who called you.

4
00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:13.590
Rival teachers have reached
Galatia with demands:

5
00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:17.670
circumcision, the Jewish
calendar, probably food laws.

6
00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:21.060
Paul even says he resisted
Peter to his face.

7
00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:25.070
So why did circumcision for
new believers matter so much?

8
00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:28.660
In this mission, you'll trace a
timeline from Abraham's promise,

9
00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:32.500
430 years before the Law, to Christ.

10
00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:37.020
Then you'll compare how Luther, Catholic
teaching and the New Perspective read

11
00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:38.050
Paul.

12
00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:42.840
Your mission: explain why circumcision
mattered so much in Galatia.
